{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15881","headline":"送余赞善使还赴薛尚书幕 · 张南史","name":"送余赞善使还赴薛尚书幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"音书不可论，河塞雪纷纷。\n雁足期苏武，狐裘见薛君。\n城池通紫陌，鞍马入黄云。\n远棹漳渠水，平流几处分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}